        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christy Cabanne, David Howard\n- Works: The Stealers\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, silent film actor\n\nFacts:\n- William Christy Cabanne was born on April 16, 1888, and he was an American film director, screenwriter, and silent film actor.\n- David Howard was born on October 6, 1896, and he was an American film director.\n- The Stealers is a 1920 American silent drama film directed by Christy Cabanne.\n- David Howard died on December 21, 1941.\n- William Christy Cabanne died on October 15, 1950.",
